<title>USA: IPO PRICING - General prices at top of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - General prices at top of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	General Cigar Holdings Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $18</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $16 - $18</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			6,000,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The company raised the estimated price range for its planned initial public offering for six million Class A shares to $16 to $18 from $14 to $16 previously.</p>
</text>
